+/// Whether a comparison may read the caller's `length` bytes at `pages` now, and write them where
+/// `writes` ([`reachable_now`]; the module docs, "Pages that go").
+fn pages_reachable(pages: NonNull<u8>, length: usize, writes: bool) -> bool {
